exists su name pset gjat from filename "iwsp-attention-embedding-table.bin" by ve num 48 0 as name float with ve num 3 4 be pfun myoc ya
exists su name lwat txik from filename "iwsp-attention-token-ids.bin" by ve num 4 0 as name number_ with ve num 2 be pfun myoc ya

su name candidate prediction to name vec float answer be ceremony def
exists su name features first via state "vector float32" by num 4 be variable ya
exists su name features second via state "vector float32" by num 4 be variable ya
exists su name hwas via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name htis hsek via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name htis hsek second via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name hnuc gjat via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name hnuc gjat second via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name prediction via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya

from name pset gjat at name lwat txik fromindex num 0 to name features first be tsoc hsat do
from name pset gjat at name lwat txik fromindex num 1 to name features second be tsoc hsat do

ob name features first by ve float32 1 0 0 0 to name hwas at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 1 0 0 0 to name hwas at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 1 0 0 0 to name htis hsek at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 0 1 0 0 to name htis hsek at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 1 0 0 0 to name htis hsek second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 0 1 0 0 to name htis hsek second at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 0 0 1 0 to name hnuc gjat at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 0 0 0 1 to name hnuc gjat at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 0 0 1 0 to name hnuc gjat second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 0 0 0 1 to name hnuc gjat second at num 1 be kl6m psas do

ob name hwas by name htis hsek to name prediction at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name hwas by name htis hsek second to name prediction at num 1 be kl6m psas do
from name prediction to name float count be gjat bwit do
from name prediction with name count to name vec float prediction be subtract do
from name prediction to name vec float prediction be exponential do
from name prediction to name float count be tfo2t do
from name prediction with name count to name vec float prediction be dvis do
from name prediction at num 0 to name float weight first be choose do
from name prediction at num 1 to name float weight second be choose do
from name hnuc gjat with name weight first to name vec float hnuc gjat be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat second with name weight second to name vec float hnuc gjat second be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat with name hnuc gjat second to name vec float hnuc gjat be plus do
su name hnuc gjat ret
su name candidate prediction be ceremony prah

to name vec float answer be candidate prediction do
